<title>USA: Alumax unit lifts common alloy sheet prices.</title>
<headline>Alumax unit lifts common alloy sheet prices.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alumax Mill Products Inc, a unit of Alumax Inc, said on Friday it is increasing common alloy sheet transaction prices by $0.05 per pound.</p>
<p>The increase applies to original equipment manufacturer (OEM) and distributor production orders as well as distributor depot sales.</p>
<p>The new prices apply to orders as of Nov. 13, 1996, and shipments on or after Dec. 2, 1996, regardless of order entry date.</p>
